      "id": "experience-firsthand_observations",
      "kind": "experience",
      "text": "Joel Hellermark asked: Why ask employees to email their priorities? He wants direct observations from employees and reads short updates to understand what they are seeing across the company. Patrick Collison asked: What meetings does he spend his time in? He says he leaves routine operations to the people who run them and focuses on problems where his involvement can help.",
