      "id": "experience-customer_problem_focus",
      "kind": "experience",
      "text": "Joel Hellermark asked: What makes an AI application business defensible? Deep knowledge of a customer's problems still matters when the underlying model becomes broadly available. Dwarkesh Patel asked: Why support cloud companies instead of becoming a hyperscaler? He describes focusing NVIDIA's effort on building its computing platform and supporting companies that can supply cloud services.",
